F]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Connect all scan entrypoints and route annotation follow-ups[/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]scan-integration[dim] · [dim][/dim]after v2-execution[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]scan-integration: share one locator index across parallel planning, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]activate v2 sync in human and JSON scans, and rebase annotation writes [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]at execution.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Finish reports, documentation, and acceptance verification[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]verify-ref-sync[dim] · [dim][/dim]after scan-integration[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]verify-ref-sync: complete human reports and docs, cover the full [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]acceptance matrix, run the repository checks, and give the land agent [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]closure evidence.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-62","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-62.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-dc84957b16e3e0ea1c3507c411975ecd","started_at":"2026-10-09T19:49:10.107263+00:00","state":"completed"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-62","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-62.1","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-62.2","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-62.3","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-62.4","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-62.land"]}
